{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant parallel world lies Gugu, a city where the legend of the &quot;Chicken God&quot; has been passed down for generations. According to myth, whenever hunger and disaster strike, the Chicken God returns to the human world, using his legendary cooking skills to nourish the people of Gugu and stave off calamity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as time passed, the Chicken God's power weakened, and gluttonous monsters from another dimension began to stir once more. In a final act of hope, the Chicken God sent out a mysterious signal across the parallel worlds \u2014 a message only the Kun Clan could receive. Is this a divine trial, or a call for redemption? Either way, Kun\u2019s great adventure is about to begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/4a5f7fd092246e80b35ebdb23edd12ed.avif?t=1759548942\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Basketboy's Adventure</i> is a charming 2D action RPG where you\u2019ll guide Kun through the semi-open city of Gugu. Explore vibrant neighborhoods, uncover hidden threats, and \u2014 of course \u2014 pick up your basketball to defend the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/c68a5d277b42094c63860967422797f1.avif?t=1759548942\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Key Features</strong> \u25c6</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art that brings every scene and character to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet satisfying 2D controls: run, dash, attack, and throw your basketball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a semi-open world packed with unique buildings and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own pace \u2014 fight relentlessly or take time to collect and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and upgrade your stats to become a true hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of quirky enemies and epic bosses with unforgettable designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise adorable pets to fight alongside you on your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame-by-frame animations bring a lively cartoon world bursting with personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to classic K-pop and Asian pop culture with a unique cartoon twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/133167f7b152cb8fab62b8c0fcd84292.avif?t=1759548942\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our official Discord to be part of the community and stay updated on the latest news!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3478660?t=1759548942","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/65ab2e606e353ef9cd125bfee0311c7a5ba03f00/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759548942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/31a54bb7a9cb5cddeb7bdc74b904b08e4111b5cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759548942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/31a54bb7a9cb5cddeb7bdc74b904b08e4111b5cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759548942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3639810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant parallel world lies Gugu, a city where the legend of the &quot;Chicken God&quot; has been passed down for generations. According to myth, whenever hunger and disaster strike, the Chicken God returns to the human world, using his legendary cooking skills to nourish the people of Gugu and stave off calamity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as time passed, the Chicken God's power weakened, and gluttonous monsters from another dimension began to stir once more. In a final act of hope, the Chicken God sent out a mysterious signal across the parallel worlds \u2014 a message only the Kun Clan could receive. Is this a divine trial, or a call for redemption? Either way, Kun\u2019s great adventure is about to begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/4a5f7fd092246e80b35ebdb23edd12ed.avif?t=1759548942\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Basketboy's Adventure</i> is a charming 2D action RPG where you\u2019ll guide Kun through the semi-open city of Gugu. Explore vibrant neighborhoods, uncover hidden threats, and \u2014 of course \u2014 pick up your basketball to defend the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/c68a5d277b42094c63860967422797f1.avif?t=1759548942\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Key Features</strong> \u25c6</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art that brings every scene and character to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet satisfying 2D controls: run, dash, attack, and throw your basketball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a semi-open world packed with unique buildings and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own pace \u2014 fight relentlessly or take time to collect and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and upgrade your stats to become a true hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of quirky enemies and epic bosses with unforgettable designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise adorable pets to fight alongside you on your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame-by-frame animations bring a lively cartoon world bursting with personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to classic K-pop and Asian pop culture with a unique cartoon twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/extras/133167f7b152cb8fab62b8c0fcd84292.avif?t=1759548942\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our official Discord to be part of the community and stay updated on the latest news!</p>","developers":["greenteagame1"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478660/ad100d38193841fa416a0adbc584384e0ea7f82c/header.jpg?t=1759548942","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3478660/1844026033/92be079df26b0d45119ae543e0104a8b34a2033c/1759495678/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759496080","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3478660/1844026033/92be079df26b0d45119ae543e0104a8b34a2033c/1759495678/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759496080","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3478660/1844026033/92be079df26b0d45119ae543e0104a8b34a2033c/1759495678/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759496080","id":257211381,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257211381/movie480.mp4?t=1759496080","max":"https://vide